# 构建上下文 = 仓库根。排除巨型且可由构建重建/不需要的目录，显著加快上下文传输。
# 注意：dashboard 阶段会 `npm ci` 重新安装依赖，故 node_modules 无需进上下文。
.git
**/.git
dashboard/node_modules
dashboard/dist
dashboard/screenshots
dashboard/test-results
dashboard/playwright-report
dashboard/playwright/.cache
control-plane/bin
third_party/rustdesk-server/target
**/*.log
NOTES.md
